istening to  them start to surround yourself with  people things ideas and a routine that  build you up and make you believe in  your idea because I'd hate seeing a  young person with dreams and ambition be  squashed down by somebody who never had  any big dreams or ambition and I only  hope that as a father of a child who's  now almost six years old I'll still  remember those lessons in mind when I'm  giving him advice on what he can and  can't do as he grows up believe those of  you guys watching I love to hear what  you have to think leave a comment below  and if you liked this video you want to  see more subscribe to the channel thank  you so much for watching I'll see you  soon self-improvement books are like  fitness books they never work on their  own what you need is a trainer that's  Evan get the newsletter  you
 

